  "rawVectorDefinition": "U_j=[4*2^j*(1+epsilon)+3*3^j*I4+4*3^j*(J1+J2)]*Bamp_(j+1)^2. This is a Euclidean vector bound obtained by summing the three phase-free component bounds from the pinned raw receipt.",
